Zero point energy                ...      0.26266540 Eh     164.82 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01082197 Eh       6.79 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
